    "title": "JobleticsPro",
    "description": "Are you a business looking to hire temporary staff or a job seeker looking to earn more money?\r\n\r\nDownload\u200b the JobleticsPro app\u200b now   \r\n\r\nWith the JobleticsPro app, You can post your open positions for free. job seekers can accept or decline your offer to work.\r\n \r\nJobleticsPro has thousands of highly-vetted workers across diverse sectors to fulfill all your staffing requirements.\r\n\r\nJobleticsPro lets you post your available shift anytime. Part-time, Full time or last minute. Whenever you need staff, post it in the app.\r\n \r\nHighlights of Staffing services from JobleticsPro\r\n \r\nEnd-to-End Payroll Outsourcing\r\n\r\nWe will manage all standard contractual procedures\r\n\r\nWe pay all benefits, Taxes and workers comp so you don't have to.\r\n\r\nStatutory compliance, remittance of statutory payments, and other related administration.\r\n\r\nEmployee registration under ESIC & EPF Schemes\r\n\r\nBartenders\r\nCooks\r\nServers/Waitstaff\r\nPrep Cooks\r\nChef\r\nSous Chef\r\nDishwashers\r\nMaintenance Personnel\r\nHousekeepers\r\nFloor Techs\r\nWarehouse\r\nAdmin\r\nEvent Staff",
